  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct criminal conduct. First, the defendant and accomplices assaulted the victim, causing multiple bone fractures that were medically classified as a light injury. This satisfies the elements of intentional injury (故意伤害). Second, the defendant made false statements about possessing TNT and planning an explosion at a police station, prompting emergency police response and disrupting public order. This conduct matches the statutory offense of fabricating false terrorist information (编造虚假恐怖信息罪). Both crimes are distinct and should be listed together.",
